        ],
        "text": "The False Claims Act imposes civil liability on any person who presents false or fraudulent claims for payment to the Federal Government."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f2238ca1e79ff267c93cd48ecb31b40a14db3f7f5382ec3ab7dd33166d6ea34a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f2238ca1e79f-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "f2238ca1e79ff267c93cd48ecb31b40a14db3f7f5382ec3ab7dd33166d6ea34a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f2238ca1e79f-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "In this case, the relator, Dr. Jesse Polansky, filed a qui tam action alleging that Executive Health Resources helped hospitals overbill Medicare."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
