            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court affirmed the judgment dismissing the action under Federal Rule\u202f41, confirming the government\u2019s entitlement to dismiss the qui tam suit."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f2238ca1e79ff267c93cd48ecb31b40a14db3f7f5382ec3ab7dd33166d6ea34a",
